  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M&amp;E Toolkit: OCFT Sector-Specific Interventions and Cross-Cutting Themes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To help build OCFT/ILAB&apos;s capacity to better measure, target, monitor, and evaluate project interventions. The project will address interventions related to issues of: occupational safety and health, forced labor, youth employment, labor-related technical and institutional capacity-building, gender and diversity, persons with disabilities, and migration.</narrative>
  </description>
